      "content": "it's just so tiring. trying to find \"small things\" feels like trying to catch smoke with my bare hands. everything is just so heavy and pointless. i look at the world and i don't see a place for me in it. it feels more like a dream i'm waking up from than a life i'm living. wouldn't it be more peaceful to just... fade out? to just stop resisting the nothingness?",
